WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.668
Welcome to Module 12 Views and Modular Queries This
module

00:00:05.694 --> 00:00:11.980
is about turning useful SQL logic into reusable
database interfaces We

00:00:11.994 --> 00:00:17.875
will learn standard views materialized views
updatable views check options dependency inspection

00:00:18.086 --> 00:00:23.821
freshness policies and modular query design The
central idea

00:00:23.834 --> 00:00:28.113
is that a view is not just saved text It is an
interface with a

00:00:28.139 --> 00:00:32.547
row grain a set of columns and a meaning that
downstream users may depend on
